    "background_story": "Dominic was a rugged outdoorsman who spent most of his life exploring the American Southwest. Growing up in a small desert town, he developed a deep respect for the land and its creatures. One animal in particular fascinated him - the coyote. Dominic spent years studying the coyote's behavior, learning to track and understand their social structures. He became known among locals as the 'Coyote Whisperer' for his uncanny ability to approach and observe these wild canines. As a wildlife conservationist, Dominic worked tirelessly to protect coyote habitats and educate the public about the importance of coexisting with these intelligent and resourceful animals. His nickname 'Coyote' stuck, a testament to his deep connection with the natural world and its most resilient inhabitants.",
